{"reviews":[{"id":"B07JF4C4C2-0","r":1.0,"t":"212pies not 240","x":"Counted out of curiosity and total number of beads was 212 pieces not 240 as stated be true to us customers please.  Its wrong to advertise one thing and sell another","h":31,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07JF4C4C2-1","r":5.0,"t":"Larger bead, great sparkle","x":"I love these beads. They are a larger bead. The sparkle is a nice touch and they appear to be sturdy, no chipping or flaking. I am happy overall.","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B07JF4C4C2-2","r":2.0,"t":"Solid yellow under the gold paint \ud83d\ude15","x":"They were very shiny when they arrived. Nice size. But after 1 week of wear, they are no longer gold.","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B07JF4C4C2-3","r":5.0,"t":"Worked well for braids","x":"Got these to put on my girls bigger braids.  They have held up well (she's pretty active and we have a problem with beads getting smashed off, but she hasn't lost any of these after a week).  There were 8 different colors (some very close to the same) of pink plus white and clear, but they all coordinated well and were a good mix of see-through and solid. It came with a small plastic threader that is probably not going to last forever, but worked. It holds about 6 beads at a time.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07JF4C4C2-4","r":1.0,"t":"Very disappointed!","x":"The beads are not as vibrant in color as they appear in the picture. Plus I super upset that they charge 7.99 for these beads when this is the exact same brand they sell at the local beauty supply for 3.50. Don't waste your money on these beads.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B07JF4C4C2-5","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect","x":"ITS LITERALLY WHAT I NEED AND THEY BIG LIKE I WANTED THEM TO BUT IM SO IN LOVE WIT THE BEADS.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B07JF4C4C2-6","r":5.0,"t":"Super Cute!","x":"These beads are super cute and very easy to put on. Love the glitter!","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07JF4C4C2-7","r":5.0,"t":"Cute & The Perfect Size","x":"These are the exact size & color beads that I was looking for to achieve the style my daughter wanted. & It only took one pack. Love these and will be buying more in different colors!","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B07JF4C4C2-8","r":5.0,"t":"Great Beads","x":"I love the beads! It was perfect for my box braids. They are larger than usual which was a pleasant surprise.  I'm bringing back that 70s beads style","h":4,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B07JF4C4C2-9","r":3.0,"t":"Not 240 in package","x":"I\u2019m pretty upset that it\u2019s not really 240 beads in the package.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B07JF4C4C2-10","r":1.0,"t":"Don\u2019t buy the colored beads!! Stains skin and clothing! I bought the pink clear and white","x":"I bought these beads for my 3 year old daughter and I was so excited... but not even a full hour my daughter\u2019s white shirt she\u2019s only worn twice got stained with pink everywhere! It\u2019s on her neck, ears and scalp!!! I\u2019ll never buy these again! It seems like they were sprayed on with cheap spray paint! It isn\u2019t coming off her skin so we\u2019ll see how long it\u2019ll takes... Don\u2019t buy the colored beads!! I bought the pink clear and white. The quality of the white and clear are fine but the pink stained ev","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B07JF4C4C2-11","r":5.0,"t":"Cute Look","x":"These are cute. I put them on my daughter's hair when I know she is going to wear something with a hint of gold in it but since they are clear, they do not look bad with other clothing colors either. BE SURE to know what size to get for your child's braids; the measurement for these are not the best look for thin braids.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B07JF4C4C2-12","r":4.0,"t":"Bead Size","x":"I didn\u2019t pay attention to the measurements of the beads, but they appear to be of good quality. If anyone is wondering what the size is, I would say medium sized beads. They aren\u2019t the standard small sized ones. I love the glitter gold color.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B07JF4C4C2-13","r":5.0,"t":"Best Worth","x":"Best worth for the bucks. Highly recommended. Cheap and stays long. Pretty much all you can ask for.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B07JF4C4C2-14","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful beads","x":"Thank you for this beautiful beads . They were easy to put on and I will get more","h":3,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B07JF4C4C2-15","r":4.0,"t":"The size I was looking for \ud83d\udc4d\ud83c\udffc","x":"These are just the size I was looking for, the bigger ones I typically get from any hair store for 1.99 lol Since hair stores are closed (covid19) well $8 on amazon it is! I got two packs: the pink glittery and the blue tie dye/marble looking ones There was substantially less in the marble looking pack, to be expected I suppose... I think every avenue I\u2019ve looked is over priced right now, these were less overpriced. Good beads, served their purpose!","h":2,"v":0,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B07JF4C4C2-16","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent!","x":"[[VIDEOID:17aa8ec8e5dea8333e49c0432b5181e1]] Everything came as pictured and the beads are thick and durable! I received 239 beads and 1 beading tool. They can be used over and over again. I bought the clear beads and mixed them with some blue ones that I already had.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B07JF4C4C2-17","r":1.0,"t":"Deceptive Advertising!!","x":"The item said 240 beads... I received 62 hair beads and no beading tool!!!! This is not right and unacceptable!!!! I will NEVER ORDER AGAIN FROM THIS SELLER!!!!","h":2,"v":0,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B07JF4C4C2-18","r":5.0,"t":"Nice and big","x":"[[VIDEOID:fc162506183d8a63b6ec40749b08b2b9]] I love that these were the big beads! My niece loved them as well, dancing and shaking them every chance she got.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B07JF4C4C2-19","r":4.0,"t":"Pinks are a lil off from the original picture","x":"Beads where perfect only problem was the pinks were a lip off other then that my 2 year old loves them","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07JF4C4C2-20","r":5.0,"t":"Excitement overload","x":"We haven\u2019t used them yet. But when she got them in the mail she was extremely excited and happy.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B07JF4C4C2-21","r":4.0,"t":"Great except didn\u2019t get beading tool","x":"Mine didn\u2019t come with the beading wand which kind of made it harder but all in all good beads","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B07JF4C4C2-22","r":5.0,"t":"Lovely","x":"Love the colors! Love the fast turn around. Looks lovely on my macrame' keychains","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B07JF4C4C2-23","r":5.0,"t":"Nice beads!","x":"The beads were perfect for my bracelets.  I have no complaints, I love them!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B07JF4C4C2-24","r":5.0,"t":"Sparkly","x":"Big holes. Exactly as I needed for braids! I bought 3 other colors.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many customers love the beads, praising their larger size, sparkle, and ease of use.","cites":[2,6,7,8,9,13,14,15]},{"text":"Some customers report receiving fewer beads than the advertised 240 count.","cites":[1,10]},{"text":"A few customers complain that the gold finish wears off or the colored beads stain skin and clothing.","cites":[3,11]},{"text":"Some reviewers feel the colors are less vibrant than pictured or that the price is too high.","cites":[5]},{"text":"Several customers note the beads hold up well for braids and active wear.","cites":[4,9,14]}]},"qa":[]}